                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "The regulator is\nready, with its\nparts signed over\nto the public",
                                        "repair crew. Your\nown workshop stock\nstays safely on\nits shelf. Your",
                                        "policy will shape\nthe response to a\nlater shortage.\nRivet takes the",
                                        "musical chair off\nthe repair queue\nuntil someone\nfinds its own",
                                        "spring."
